&P262219 = PBS 08/2, 115 
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. 1(u) gin2 e2 du3-a# da e2 ha-la-ba-ni 
#tr.en: A built house plot of 10 shekels adjacent to the house (that is) his portion (of the inheritance);
2. 1(iku) 1/2(iku) GAN2 sza3 a-sza3 mar#-ra us2-a-du ha-la-ba-ni 
#tr.en: (a plot of) 3/2 ikû in the "field of the shovel" district, alongside his portion (of the inheritance);
