#tr.en: adjacent to the house of Dingir-azu;
7. 3(iku) GAN2 sza3# a-sza3 mar-ra 
#tr.en: (a plot of) 3 ikû in the "field of the shovel" district,
8. us2-a-du ha-[la]-pa-a-a [(x) (x)] 
#tr.en: alongside (the property of) Ḫalapaya ...
