#tr.en: alongside (the property of) I(d)din-šamaš;
14. ha-la-ba u-bar-{d#}utu# 
#tr.en: is the portion (of the inheritance) of Ubar-šamaš.
15. 1/3(disz) sar [5(disz)] gin2 e2 du3-a 
#tr.en: A built house plot of 25 shekels,
16. da e2 u-bar-{d#}utu# 
#tr.en: adjacent to the house of Ubar-šamaš;
